    <string name="help_faq_link_tablet_q">How do I link a new tablet?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_link_tablet_a">In Profile → Devices, tap “Link another device” and enter the 5-character code shown on the tablet. The code expires after 5 minutes.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_ai_suggestions_q">Where do the AI suggestions come from?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_ai_suggestions_a">They come from what your customers search for on the tablet and from your recent sales: products they couldn\'t find and products that are running out.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_offline_q">Can I use the app without internet?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_offline_a">You need internet to see orders and update your inventory. The tablet keeps its catalog and keeps showing it if it loses the connection for a while.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_prices_q">How do I change the prices customers see?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_prices_a">Edit the product in Inventory. The tablet gets the new price on its next sync, or right away with “Refresh catalog” in Devices.</string>
